---
pagination:
  data: incentiveIndex.incentives
  size: 1
  alias: inc
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ inc.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Film incentive in {{ inc.name }}"
  seo_title: "{{ inc.name }} Film Tax Incentive {{ inc.shortRate }}: {{ inc.shortScheme }} | Tubes"
  description: "How the {{ inc.scheme }} works: {{ inc.rate_label }} {{ inc.mechanism | lower }}, minimum spend, cap, when it pays out and what it is worth net. Checked against the source on {{ incentiveIndex.updated }}."
---
{#- Pagina per regeling. De vergelijkingstool op /compare-film-incentives/
    rekent; deze pagina legt uit. Alle cijfers komen uit locations.json, zodat
    de tool en deze pagina nooit uiteen kunnen lopen, en elke pagina noemt de
    bron en de datum waarop we die bron gelezen hebben.

    Niets wordt hier geschat: staat er een veld leeg in de data, dan staat het
    er niet. Een verzonnen plafond gaat een producent gebruiken om te plannen. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner has-promo">
    <div class="company-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/film-incentives/">Film incentives</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ inc.name }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="/film-incentives/">Incentives</a></p>
      <h1>Film and TV incentive in {{ inc.inName }}</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">
        {{ inc.inName | capitalize_first }} runs the {{ inc.scheme }}: a {{ inc.mechanism | lower }} worth {{ inc.rate_label }}{% if inc.net_label %}, {{ inc.net_label }}{% endif %}.
        {{ inc.mechanismNote }}
      </p>
    </header>
    {% set promoVariant = "inline" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}

    <h2>The numbers</h2>
    <dl class="inc-facts">
      <div><dt>Scheme</dt><dd>{{ inc.scheme }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Type</dt><dd><span class="loc-tag loc-tag-{{ inc.mechanism | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ inc.mechanism }}</span></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Headline rate</dt><dd>{{ inc.rate_label }}{% if inc.net_label %} <small>({{ inc.net_label }})</small>{% endif %}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Minimum local spend</dt><dd>{{ inc.min_spend }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Cap per project</dt><dd>{{ inc.cap_label or "No cap" }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Funding</dt><dd><span class="loc-tag loc-tag-{{ inc.funding | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ inc.funding }}</span>{% if inc.funding_note %} <small>{{ inc.funding_note }}</small>{% endif %}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Paid</dt><dd>{{ inc.paid }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Foreign spend qualifies</dt><dd>{{ inc.foreign_spend }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Currency</dt><dd>{{ inc.currency }}</dd></div>
    </dl>

    {%- if inc.extras.length %}
    <h2>Higher rates and tiers</h2>
    <ul class="company-links">
      {%- for e in inc.extras %}
      <li>{{ e }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}

    <h2>What this means for the cashflow</h2>
    <div class="rich-text">
      <p>{{ inc.fundingNote }} The production carries the gap until the money arrives, and that is a financing question rather than a budget line.</p>
      <p><strong>When it pays:</strong> {{ inc.paid }}.</p>
      {%- if inc.assumption %}
      <p><strong>Our assumption in the comparison:</strong> {{ inc.assumption }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>

    {%- if inc.notes %}
    <h2>The detail</h2>
    <div class="rich-text"><p>{{ inc.notes }}</p></div>
    {%- endif %}

    {%- if inc.budget_template %}
    <h2>What you have to submit</h2>
    <div class="rich-text">
      <p><a href="{{ inc.budget_template.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ inc.budget_template.label }}</a>{% if inc.budget_template.note %}. {{ inc.budget_template.note }}{% endif %}</p>
      <p>Building the budget first? Use the <a href="/film-budget-template/">free film budget template</a> or the <a href="/tools/budget-builder/">Budget Builder</a>, then map it onto whatever the fund asks for.</p>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}

    <h2>How it compares</h2>
    <p>
      Counted on the best rate a production can reach after tax, {{ inc.name }} sits at number {{ inc.rank }} of the {{ incentiveIndex.total }} European schemes we track ({{ inc.topRate }}%).
      Work out the net value on your own spend, side by side with up to two other countries, in the <a href="/compare-film-incentives/">incentive comparison</a>.
    </p>
    {%- if inc.higher.length %}
    <h3>Pays more</h3>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for o in inc.higher %}
      <li><a href="{{ o.url }}">{{ o.name }} <span>{{ o.rate_label }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if inc.lower.length %}
    <h3>Pays less</h3>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for o in inc.lower %}
      <li><a href="{{ o.url }}">{{ o.name }} <span>{{ o.rate_label }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if inc.sameMechanism.length %}
    <h3>Other {{ inc.mechanism | lower }} schemes</h3>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for o in inc.sameMechanism %}
      <li><a href="{{ o.url }}">{{ o.name }} <span>{{ o.rate_label }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}

    {%- if inc.guide.locations or inc.guide.companies %}
    <h2>Shooting there</h2>
    <p>
      {%- if inc.guide.locations %} We list <a href="{{ inc.guide.locationsUrl }}">{{ inc.guide.locations }} places to shoot in {{ inc.guide.country }}</a>{% endif %}
      {%- if inc.guide.locations and inc.guide.companies %} and{% endif %}
      {%- if inc.guide.companies %} <a href="{{ inc.guide.companiesUrl }}">{{ inc.guide.companies }} studios, production companies and post houses</a>{% endif %}, each checked on its own site.
    </p>
    {%- endif %}

    <h2>Source</h2>
    <p class="company-summary">
      Figures taken from <a href="{{ inc.source }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ inc.source_label }}</a> and checked on {{ incentiveIndex.updated }}. Incentives change: confirm the current terms with the fund before you commit a budget to them.
    </p>

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="/film-incentives/">All {{ incentiveIndex.total }} incentives</a> &middot;
      <a href="/compare-film-incentives/">Compare them on your own spend</a> &middot;
      <a href="/film-locations/">Locations by country</a>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-side">{% set promoVariant = "aside" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Turning an incentive into a budget?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, so qualifying spend, the gap until payout and the rest of the finance plan stay in one place.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
